        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>江海证券 小白必学 月度行情概念</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f5b12a;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f5b12a;\n    padding: 10px 10px 6px 10px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .sheet {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 14px 16px 10px 16px;\n  }\n  /* header */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .logo-mark {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    background: #c8102e;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .logo-text .cn {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #1a2f6b;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .logo-text .en {\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #1a2f6b;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #1a2f6b;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    border: 2px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #333;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .badge .placeholder {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 26px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  /* month rows */\n  .arrow-row {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .arrow-cell {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .arrow-down {\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    border-left: 13px solid transparent;\n    border-right: 13px solid transparent;\n    border-top: 20px solid #2f7de1;\n  }\n  .arrow-green { border-top-color: #4caf50; }\n  .arrow-red { border-top-color: #d32f2f; }\n  .arrow-yellow { border-top-color: #f0b429; }\n  .arrow-blue { border-top-color: #2f7de1; }\n\n  .month-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .month-line {\n    flex: 1;\n    height: 6px;\n    background: #e8e8e8;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n  .month-cell {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .cards {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .card-title {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .t-blue { background: #2f7de1; }\n  .t-green { background: #4caf50; }\n  .t-red { background: #d32f2f; }\n  .t-yellow { background: #f0b429; }\n  .card-body {\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    padding: 10px 9px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: justify;\n    min-height: 150px;\n  }\n  .em-red {\n    color: #d32f2f;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  /* footer */\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #333;\n    padding: 8px 4px 2px 4px;\n  }\n  .footer div { white-space: nowrap; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"sheet\">\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <div class=\"logo-mark\">J</div>\n        <div class=\"logo-text\">\n          <div class=\"cn\">江海证券</div>\n          <div class=\"en\">JIANGHAI SECURITIES</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"badge\">\n        小白必学\n        <span class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: hand, right of badge]</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 4月 5月 6月 -->\n    <div class=\"arrow-row\">\n      <div class=\"arrow-cell\"><div class=\"arrow-down arrow-blue\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-cell\"><div class=\"arrow-down arrow-green\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-cell\"><div class=\"arrow-down arrow-red\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"month-row\">\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"month-cell\">4月</div>\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"month-cell\">5月</div>\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"month-cell\">6月</div>\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title t-blue\">业绩财报高送转</div>\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          上市公司集中公布<span class=\"em-red\">上年年报和当年一季报甚至会有高送转超预期情况</span>，市场会有一大波炒作，但要规避业绩踩雷\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title t-green\">酒店旅游客运</div>\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          其中重要节假日五一长假来临，<span class=\"em-red\">往往会迎来一大波旅行旅游潮</span>，相关的酒店、景点、航空股通常会有资金提前埋伏\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title t-red\">中小市值概念股</div>\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <span class=\"em-red\">五穷六绝，六月市场波动可能比较大</span>，中小市值公司更容易受到影响，引发概念游资炒作，注意<span class=\"em-red\">金融机构年中结算</span>，市场流动性可能紧张，需要做好严格仓位管理\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 7月 8月 9月 -->\n    <div class=\"arrow-row\">\n      <div class=\"arrow-cell\"><div class=\"arrow-down arrow-yellow\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-cell\"><div class=\"arrow-down arrow-blue\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-cell\"><div class=\"arrow-down arrow-green\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"month-row\">\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"month-cell\">7月</div>\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"month-cell\">8月</div>\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"month-cell\">9月</div>\n      <div class=\"month-line\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title t-yellow\">七翻身抓新概念</div>\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          下半年，市场资金也会再次开始活跃，下年是妖股起飞时节，经过前两个多月体整，很多<span class=\"em-red\">概念题材会迎来新的机会</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title t-blue\">炒科技板块</div>\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          各大品牌手机厂商会陆续发布新品，如苹果、华为将引发市场科技热潮，<span class=\"em-red\">此时是掘金科技股产业链的好时机</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title t-green\">军工相关</div>\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          建军节、国庆节，按照惯例9月份竣工相关大幅跑赢其他板块\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div>个股仅做展示，不做推荐</div>\n    <div>投资有风险，入市需谨慎</div>\n    <div>仅为理论知识，不构成投资建议</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
